{icon:BossPower_B_Icon, 2}{if:SF_19}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Main{/c}
Casting a {c_important}Core{/c} Skill while you have a {c_important}{u}Barrier{/u}{/c} Knocks Down Close enemies for {c_random}[{SF_1}|1|]{/c} seconds. This cannot occur on the same enemy more than once every {c_number}[{SF_20}]{/c} seconds.
{if:SF_19}{/c}{/if}
{icon:BossPower_A_Icon, 2}{if:SF_18}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Modifier{/c}
Whenever you gain {c_important}{u}Fortify{/u}{/c}, additionally gain {c_random}[{SF_6}*100|%|]{/c} of the amount as {c_important}{u}Barrier{/u}{/c} for {c_number}[{SF_7}]{/c} seconds.{if:SF_18}{/c}{/if}
